        "original_id": "8baa0c29-95dd-526e-8174-ab1ec60d99ff",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Musicals: If/Then, Bring It On the Musical, American Idiot, Everyday Rapture\n- People: Brian Yorkey, Tom Kitt, Michael Greif, Janet Krupin\n- Awards: Tony Award, Outer Critics Circle Award, Drama Desk Award\n- Roles: Kylar, swing\n\nFacts:\n- If/Then is a musical with a libretto by Brian Yorkey, a theatrical score by Tom Kitt, and direction by Michael Greif.\n- Tom Kitt won the Tony Award and the 2008 Outer Critics Circle Award, and he was nominated for a Drama Desk Award for American Idiot and Everyday Rapture.\n- On Broadway, Janet Krupin originated the role of Kylar in Bring It On the Musical.\n- On Broadway, Janet Krupin was a swing in If/Then.",
